because I don't know what position I'm in.

00:25:01.640 --> 00:25:04.690
That's the downside of
a hanging out so much.

00:25:04.690 --> 00:25:07.570
I don't really know where I
run on other people's lists.

00:25:07.570 --> 00:25:10.090
I don't know if I'm at the top.

00:25:10.090 --> 00:25:11.500
I don't know if I'm in the middle.

00:25:11.500 --> 00:25:13.930
So I'm kind of concerned
that I might be at the bottom

00:25:13.930 --> 00:25:16.283
for some people and I don't want that.

00:25:19.905 --> 00:25:22.738
(monitor beeping)

00:25:23.970 --> 00:25:26.070
- [Announcer] Next time on Money Game.

00:25:26.070 --> 00:25:28.860
- I intend to eliminate Rek tonight.

00:25:28.860 --> 00:25:31.800
- I wouldn't miss the snoring personally.

00:25:31.800 --> 00:25:33.490
I don't know how the game
is gonna shift on us.

00:25:33.490 --> 00:25:35.870
- In this game, if we're
forced to vote each other out,

00:25:35.870 --> 00:25:37.992
there has to be some sort of deception.

00:25:37.992 --> 00:25:40.390
(Chance sobbing)

00:25:40.390 --> 00:25:42.330
- When is the shoe going to drop?

00:25:42.330 --> 00:25:45.970
- Today, you can vote
twice for the same person.

00:25:45.970 --> 00:25:46.853
- Holy shit.

